{"id":"91a7403ebc9ed855","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-order10-quotient-order-carrier.md","title":"ZFC Order10 Quotient Order Carrier","display":"df-zfc-order10-quotient-order-carrier — ZFC Order10 Quotient Order Carrier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order10-quotient-order-carrier","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order10-quotient-order-carrier"],"display":"df-zfc-order10-quotient-order-carrier — ZFC Order10 Quotient Order Carrier","depends_on":["[[58-df-quotient]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order10-quotient-order-carrier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order10-quotient-order-carrier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order10-quotient-order-carrier — ZFC Order10 Quotient Order Carrier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9ced46394294c1a6\" href=\"?note=9ced46394294c1a6\" title=\"58-df-quotient\">58-df-quotient</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,P,E\\in V\">\\(Q,P,E\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ced46394294c1a6\" href=\"?note=9ced46394294c1a6\" title=\"58-df-quotient\">58-df-quotient</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10QuotientOrderCarrier}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10QuotientOrderCarrier}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}order\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10QuotientOrderCarrier}_S(Q,P,E)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,P,E)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}order\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10QuotientOrderCarrier}_S(Q,P,E)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,P,E)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The quotient carrier is the canonical quotient set; its upstream definition already enforces that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> is an equivalence relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-quotient","status":"resolved","id":"9ced46394294c1a6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-quotient]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-quotient","status":"resolved","id":"9ced46394294c1a6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-quotient]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Q,P,E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10QuotientOrderCarrier}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}order\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10QuotientOrderCarrier}_S(Q,P,E)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,P,E)","display":true},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false}],"bytes":896,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anch